# Playwright e2e (must)

- `expect.timeout` / `use.actionTimeout`: **3000** ms in `playwright.config.ts`
- Assign every selector to a named `const`, then assert on that variable
- No `{ timeout: N }` on visibility/text/count expects or clicks (rare documented exceptions only)

```ts
const bannerTitle = page.getByText("Banner title");
await expect(bannerTitle).toBeVisible();
```

Full examples and exceptions: [`.cursor/skills/playwright-timeouts/SKILL.md`](../skills/playwright-timeouts/SKILL.md).
